{"4595350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isolation Edge", "steam_appid": 4595350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The outbreak has dismantled the foundations of civilization. Through relentless hunger, the infected have replaced humanity as Earth's apex predators. As one of the last survivors, you stand alone on the crumbling edge of civilization.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Isolation Edge </strong>— a hardcore sandbox survival game focused on a pure single-player experience. Here, there are no reinforcements, no companions — only your wits and the weapon in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/19fc4874ff136f095abf06055d8b1dd8.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/19fc4874ff136f095abf06055d8b1dd8.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/19fc4874ff136f095abf06055d8b1dd8.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey of Solitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Isolation Edge</i>, you face the end of the world alone. In this desolate land, silence is your greatest enemy and your only companion. Explore diverse ruins and wilderness regions to establish your private sanctuary. Free from the distraction of others, you must learn to endure isolation and maintain both your sanity and vigilance in this one-man war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/11c4bef9233361006caa2426c31b8bd1.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/11c4bef9233361006caa2426c31b8bd1.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/11c4bef9233361006caa2426c31b8bd1.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construct the Final &quot;Edge&quot; Fortress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no teammates to watch your back, automated defense systems become vital. Utilize a deep construction system to reclaim abandoned homes or build a steel fortress from scratch. <br> <br>[<i>]Fortify your base with electric fences, concrete barriers, and barbed wire.</i> <br><i>[</i>]Deploy intricate trap lines and establish power grids.  <br>[]Set up automated turrets to repel increasingly frantic nightly hordes alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/36a383ddb2cb955613e39ad8f7e5c7ef.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/36a383ddb2cb955613e39ad8f7e5c7ef.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/36a383ddb2cb955613e39ad8f7e5c7ef.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Off the Land or Scour the Ruins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be a scavenger prowling the remains of the old world for rare supplies and components, or retreat to the hills to sustain yourself through farming, gathering, hunting, or fishing. Manage your hunger, thirst, and wounds carefully — in this world, there is no one to care for you when you fall ill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/0284365b9821b114ba5c9004174d2677.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/0284365b9821b114ba5c9004174d2677.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/0284365b9821b114ba5c9004174d2677.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lethal Resource Management &amp; Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a comprehensive crafting system to create everything you need to survive. Use salvaged parts to craft and install scopes, extended magazines, or suppressors for your weapons. Faced with overwhelming swarms, every bullet is precious. Even without mutations, the sheer scale of the primal zombie hordes is enough to suffocate you — if you are surrounded, it means the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face a Tireless Threat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected never tire; they sense your presence and gather in swarms. While their behavior is singular, their massive numbers and endless pursuit will be your primary source of pressure. You must constantly adapt your tactics, using the terrain and your traps to outmaneuver them. There are no shortcuts to survival — every pull of the trigger must be a calculated decision.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The outbreak has dismantled the foundations of civilization. Through relentless hunger, the infected have replaced humanity as Earth's apex predators. As one of the last survivors, you stand alone on the crumbling edge of civilization.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Isolation Edge </strong>— a hardcore sandbox survival game focused on a pure single-player experience. Here, there are no reinforcements, no companions — only your wits and the weapon in your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/19fc4874ff136f095abf06055d8b1dd8.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/19fc4874ff136f095abf06055d8b1dd8.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/19fc4874ff136f095abf06055d8b1dd8.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey of Solitude</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Isolation Edge</i>, you face the end of the world alone. In this desolate land, silence is your greatest enemy and your only companion. Explore diverse ruins and wilderness regions to establish your private sanctuary. Free from the distraction of others, you must learn to endure isolation and maintain both your sanity and vigilance in this one-man war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/11c4bef9233361006caa2426c31b8bd1.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/11c4bef9233361006caa2426c31b8bd1.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/11c4bef9233361006caa2426c31b8bd1.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construct the Final &quot;Edge&quot; Fortress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no teammates to watch your back, automated defense systems become vital. Utilize a deep construction system to reclaim abandoned homes or build a steel fortress from scratch. <br> <br>[<i>]Fortify your base with electric fences, concrete barriers, and barbed wire.</i> <br><i>[</i>]Deploy intricate trap lines and establish power grids.  <br>[]Set up automated turrets to repel increasingly frantic nightly hordes alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/36a383ddb2cb955613e39ad8f7e5c7ef.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/36a383ddb2cb955613e39ad8f7e5c7ef.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/36a383ddb2cb955613e39ad8f7e5c7ef.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Off the Land or Scour the Ruins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to be a scavenger prowling the remains of the old world for rare supplies and components, or retreat to the hills to sustain yourself through farming, gathering, hunting, or fishing. Manage your hunger, thirst, and wounds carefully — in this world, there is no one to care for you when you fall ill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/0284365b9821b114ba5c9004174d2677.poster.avif?t=1784765726\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/0284365b9821b114ba5c9004174d2677.webm?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/extras/0284365b9821b114ba5c9004174d2677.mp4?t=1784765726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lethal Resource Management &amp; Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a comprehensive crafting system to create everything you need to survive. Use salvaged parts to craft and install scopes, extended magazines, or suppressors for your weapons. Faced with overwhelming swarms, every bullet is precious. Even without mutations, the sheer scale of the primal zombie hordes is enough to suffocate you — if you are surrounded, it means the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face a Tireless Threat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infected never tire; they sense your presence and gather in swarms. While their behavior is singular, their massive numbers and endless pursuit will be your primary source of pressure. You must constantly adapt your tactics, using the terrain and your traps to outmaneuver them. There are no shortcuts to survival — every pull of the trigger must be a calculated decision.</p>", "short_description": "Isolation Edge is a hardcore single-player survival game set in a desolate world reclaimed by zombies. Traverse dangerous zones to scavenge, craft gear, and build your fortress to endure the relentless hordes. The past is lost, but on this isolated edge, every breath is a victory worth fighting for.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/30cbad5126680e8e316b1749d3490cd05202454a/header.jpg?t=1784765726", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/aaf4fbd99d1955228c6c72c3127dd4dbe5ae154b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784765726", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/aaf4fbd99d1955228c6c72c3127dd4dbe5ae154b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784765726", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["EzGameStudio"], "publishers": ["EzGameStudio"], "demos": [{"appid": 4725610, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 82, "description": "#category_contrast_controls"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/da8a2109ace321b7a576038eb7fd409679621db2/ss_da8a2109ace321b7a576038eb7fd409679621db2.600x338.jpg?t=1784765726", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/da8a2109ace321b7a576038eb7fd409679621db2/ss_da8a2109ace321b7a576038eb7fd409679621db2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784765726"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/3e013232575454c18faa4a6ffc9f4614063edf41/ss_3e013232575454c18faa4a6ffc9f4614063edf41.600x338.jpg?t=1784765726", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/3e013232575454c18faa4a6ffc9f4614063edf41/ss_3e013232575454c18faa4a6ffc9f4614063edf41.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784765726"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/e3cc470bf242a2fc164c68cedc2c4c032d6eee87/ss_e3cc470bf242a2fc164c68cedc2c4c032d6eee87.600x338.jpg?t=1784765726", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/e3cc470bf242a2fc164c68cedc2c4c032d6eee87/ss_e3cc470bf242a2fc164c68cedc2c4c032d6eee87.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784765726"}, {"id": 3, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/4f43e0b6be0e340ca5d989adfab0ac6f89f3ff1a/ss_4f43e0b6be0e340ca5d989adfab0ac6f89f3ff1a.600x338.jpg?t=1784765726", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/4f43e0b6be0e340ca5d989adfab0ac6f89f3ff1a/ss_4f43e0b6be0e340ca5d989adfab0ac6f89f3ff1a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784765726"}, {"id": 4, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4595350/9c112b9d5e1859ab2641de499fcd84d775b5773c/ss_9c112b9d5e1859ab2641de499fcd84d775b5773c.600x338.jpg?t=1784765726", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps